# Build-context filter for frontend/Dockerfile ONLY. BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in
# preference to the root .dockerignore, which is tuned for the API image and excludes the frontend.
#
# An allowlist: everything is out unless named here, so nothing new in the repo (least of all a
# deploy/.env) can drift into the image by accident.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!shared/package.json
!shared/tsconfig.json
!shared/src
!backend/package.json
!frontend
!deploy/Caddyfile.lan

# Re-excluded inside the allowed directories. node_modules and dist are rebuilt in the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/*.spec.ts
